{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "NEI2016SuperFastCoupling",
    "description": "Coupling library (esm-spec §10.9) adding NEI2016 monthly anthropogenic+biogenic surface emissions as source terms to the SuperFast gas-phase mechanism. Roles: Emissions (an NEI2016MonthlyEmis component exposing per-species mixing-ratio source rates [1/s]) and Chem (SuperFast, whose species tendencies receive the emission terms). Import with coupling_import + bind {Emissions, Chem}.\n\nFive of SuperFast's species have NEI counterparts: NO, NO2, CO, ISOP, and CH2O (from NEI's FORM). CH4 is a fixed species in SuperFast so its NEI emission is intentionally not coupled, and NEI's SO2/SULF have no SuperFast counterpart.\n\nUnit conversion: the Emissions observeds are already mixing-ratio source rates in kg species / kg air / s (the flux->mixing-ratio division by g0_100*delp_dry_surface, the species-specific diurnal / day-of-week scaling, and the surface-only mask ifelse(lev<2, ..., 0) all live inside the NEI2016MonthlyEmis component). SuperFast's states are in ppb, so each term is multiplied by nmolpermol * MW_Air / MW_species = 1e9 * 28.97e-3 / MW_species, converting kg/kg_air/s -> ppb/s. The factor is written in that symbolic form below so its provenance stays legible.\n\nProvenance: jialinl6/GasChemMTK.jl@37792b29 (branch superfast-gas-only) ext/EarthSciDataExt.jl couple2(SuperFastCoupler, NEI2016MonthlyEmisCoupler), which performs the same mapping via operator_compose with conv = uconv/MW_X, uconv = nmolpermol*MW_Air. NEI's NO is NOx-as-NO2 mass, so NO is converted with MW_NO2 (46.0055e-3), not MW_NO, as upstream does. NEI2016ElevatedEmis (nei2016_elevated.esm) exposes the same species, so this library binds it as Emissions too: import it once for surface-only emissions, or once per NEI component for surface plus elevated.",
    "tags": [
      "emissions",
      "coupling-library",
      "nei2016",
      "superfast",
      "gaschem",
      "additive"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "US EPA (2020). 2016 National Emissions Inventory v1. https://gaftp.epa.gov/Air/emismod/2016/"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Source: GasChem.jl ext/EarthSciDataExt.jl, EarthSciMLBase.couple2(::SuperFastCoupler, ::NEI2016MonthlyEmisCoupler)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "coupling_roles": {
    "Emissions": {
      "description": "NEI2016MonthlyEmis component; provides per-species mixing-ratio source rates [1/s] (kg species / kg air / s), already temporally scaled and masked to the surface layer."
    },
    "Chem": {
      "description": "SuperFast gas-phase chemistry; the NO, NO2, CO, ISOP and CH2O tendencies [ppb/s] receive additive emission source terms."
    }
  },
  "coupling": [
    {
      "type": "couple",
      "systems": ["Emissions", "Chem"],
      "connector": {
        "equations": [
          {
            "from": "Emissions.NO",
            "to": "Chem.NO",
            "transform": "additive",
            "expression": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [1.0e9, 28.97e-3] }, 46.0055e-3] },
                "Emissions.NO"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "from": "Emissions.NO2",
            "to": "Chem.NO2",
            "transform": "additive",
            "expression": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [1.0e9, 28.97e-3] }, 46.0055e-3] },
                "Emissions.NO2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "from": "Emissions.CO",
            "to": "Chem.CO",
            "transform": "additive",
            "expression": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [1.0e9, 28.97e-3] }, 28.0101e-3] },
                "Emissions.CO"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "from": "Emissions.ISOP",
            "to": "Chem.ISOP",
            "transform": "additive",
            "expression": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [1.0e9, 28.97e-3] }, 68.12e-3] },
                "Emissions.ISOP"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "from": "Emissions.FORM",
            "to": "Chem.CH2O",
            "transform": "additive",
            "expression": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [1.0e9, 28.97e-3] }, 30.026e-3] },
                "Emissions.FORM"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
